r, ta'biri âharla: sana verdiği sözün veya senden aldığı emrin hılâfını yapmak için beyt yapmağa çalışır gibi tezvirat uydurmakla uğraşır, «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"39\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 38.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.8 18.8 25.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » dediği halde gönlünde ısyanı kurar, gaile çıkarmağa uğraşır, sinesinde daima bunu yatırır.»- « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"233\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 232.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 9.7 9.7 9.7 16.6 24.0 39.7 51.7 58.6 69.0 84.7 84.7 93.7 100.6 116.3 126.7 135.0 146.3 146.3 153.7 161.3 177.0 177.0 186.0 186.0 196.6 196.6 212.3 212.3 222.7\" y=\"25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0 39.7 58.6 69.0 93.7 100.6 116.3 135.0 146.3 222.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » hukmüne karşı Munafıkların ba'zısı artık Muhammed, rübubiyyet da'vasına kalkışıyor demek istemişler, bu âyet nâzil olmuştur. Surei «Âli Imran»da «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"288\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 287.5 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 15.0 22.4 38.2 49.4 49.4 56.2 64.4 64.4 71.2 71.2 78.0 78.0 84.7 91.4 107.2 114.0 114.0 114.0 120.7 128.2 144.0 154.4 162.7 162.7 162.7 169.4 169.4 182.2 182.2 198.0 198.0 207.0 207.0 213.7 213.7 220.4 220.4 240.7 240.7 251.2 251.2 267.0 267.0 277.4 277.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"78.0 91.4 107.2 144.0\" y=\"20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » bak. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"197\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 197.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 42.0 42.0 42.0 48.7 55.6 55.6 71.3 78.0 93.7 93.7 110.3 110.3 117.0 117.0 129.0 135.7 144.7 144.7 151.6 151.6 151.6 158.3 165.7 172.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 48.7 78.0 129.0 172.6 180.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> onlar gönüllerinde ne yatırırlarsa Allah da onu yazar, vahy ile sana bildirir, Kur'ana geçirir veya sırası gelince cezalarını vermek üzere defterlerine geçirir. Binaenaleyh <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"250\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 250.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.3 23.3 23.3 30.0 37.4 53.3 64.4 71.3 89.3 89.3 99.7 99.7 111.0 119.3 126.0 143.3 143.3 152.3 152.3 160.4 160.4 167.3 185.3 204.0 204.0 211.4 211.4 220.4 227.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"64.4 71.3 99.7 111.0 119.3 126.0 167.3 185.3 220.4 227.3 234.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> sen onlara bakma, her hususta Allaha mütevekkil ol, bunları da ona havale eyle<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"161\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 161.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 21.7 28.6 35.3 35.3 46.6 63.7 63.7 70.6 70.6 70.6 77.3 84.7 91.6 91.6 107.3 118.6 118.6 125.3 136.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"46.6 125.3 136.6 144.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Allah tealâ kâfi bir vekildir.</p>"}